flowchart TD
    A([Open protected page]) --> B{Local session exists?}
    B -- No --> C[/Redirect to login/]
    B -- Yes --> D[Allow every module]
    D --> E([No role-specific check])
    C --> F[/Submit username and password/]
    F --> G{Locked?}
    G -- Yes --> H[/Show cooldown/]
    G -- No --> I{Password hash matches?}
    I -- No --> J[Increment local failed count]
    J --> C
    I -- Yes --> K[Write local session]
    K --> D
    C --> L[/Forgot password: enter username/]
    L --> M[/Show stored question/]
    M --> N[/Submit answer/]
    N --> O{Answer hash matches?}
    O -- No --> P[/Show mismatch/]
    P --> N
    O -- Yes --> Q[/Enter new password/]
    Q --> R[Call reset by username]
    X[/Direct function call/] --> R
    R --> S[(Replace local password hash)]
    S --> T([Return to login])
